"false" selected="false" bounds="[106,1000][366,1047]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="A savory and satisfying alternative to scrambled eggs, perfect for a hearty start." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[106,1089][974,1185]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="• Use firm or extra-firm tofu for the best texture; press it beforehand to remove excess water." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[106,1206][974,1290]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="• Add nutritional yeast for a cheesy, savory flavor and a boost of B vitamins." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[106,1306][974,1390]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text='• For an "eggy" flavor and aroma, add a pinch of black salt (kala namak) near the end of cooking.' resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[106,1406][974,1490]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="• Mix in vegetables like spinach, bell peppers, and onions for added nutrients and fiber." resource-id="" class="android.wi